\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Blest are the pure in heart,
\par For they shall see our God;
\par The secret of the Lord is theirs,
\par Their soul is Christ's abode.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The Lord, who left the sky
\par Our life and peace to bring,
\par And dwelt in lowliness with men,
\par Their Pattern and their King-
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Still to the lowly soul
\par He doth Himself impart;
\par And for His cradle and His throne
\par Chooseth the pure in heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Lord, we Thy presence seek;
\par May ours this blessing be;
\par Give us a pure and lowly heart,
\par A temple meet for Thee.
\par                       Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

